{
  "title": "Ziyarat-e-Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sahiba alzzamani\nPeace be upon you, O Master of the Age,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خَلِیْفَۃَ الرَّحْمٰنِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya khalifata alrrahmani\npeace be upon you, O vicegerent of the All-Merciful,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا شَرِیْكَ الْقُرْآنِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sharika alqur'ani\npeace be upon you, O companion of the Qur'an,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اِمَامَ الْاِنْسِ وَالْجَانِّ\nalssalamu `alayka ya imama al-insi waljanni\npeace be upon you, O Imam of mankind and jinn.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلیٰ بَقِیَّۃِ اللّٰهِ فِیْ بِلاَدِهٖ\nalssalamu `ala baqiyyati allahi fi biladihi\nPeace be upon Allah's remnant on His earth,\nوَحُجَّتِهٖ عَلیٰ عِبَادِهِ\nwa hujjatihi `ala `ibadihi\nand His Argument over His servants,\nالْمُنْتَهیٰ اِلَیْهِ مَوَارِیْثُ الْاَنْبِیَائِ\nalmuntaha ilayhi mawarithu al-anbiya'i\nto whom the inheritances of the prophets have culminated,\nوَلَدَیْهِ مَوْجُوْدٌ اٰثَارُ الْاَصْفِیَائِ\nwa ladayhi mawjudun atharu al-asfiya'i\nand with whom are found the traces of the chosen ones,\nالْمْتَمَنِ عَلَی السِّرِّ وَلْوَلِیُّ لِلْاَمْرِ\nalmu'tamani `ala alssirri walwaliyyu lil-amri\nthe one entrusted with the secret, and the guardian in charge of the affair.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَی الْمَهْدِیِّ الَّذِیْنَ وَعَدَ اللّٰهُ عَزَّوَ جَلَّ\nalssalamu `ala almahdiyyi alladhi wa`ada allahu `azza wa jalla\nPeace be upon al-Mahdi, whom Allah, Mighty and Majestic, promised\nبِهِ الْاُمَمَ\nbihi al-umama\nthe nations\nاَنْ یَّجْمَعَ بِهِ الْكَلِمَ\nan yajma`a bihi alkalima\nthat through him He would unite the (scattered) word,\nوَیَلُّمَّ بِهِ الشّعَثَ\nwa yaluma bihi alshsha`atha\nand mend through him the disarray,\nوَیَمْلاَئَ بِهِ الْاَرْضَ قِسْطاً وَعَدْلاً\nwa yamla'a bihi al-arda qistan wa`adlan\nand fill the earth through him with fairness and justice,\nوَیُمَكِّنَ لَهٗ\nwa yumakkina lahu\nand establish him firmly,\nوَیُنْجِزَبِهٖ وَعْدَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ\nwa yunjiza bihi wa`da almu'minina\nand fulfill through him the promise made to the believers.\nاَشْهَدُ یَا مَوْلاَیَ اَنَّكَ وَالْاَئِمَّۃُ مِنْ اٰبَائِكَ اَئِمَّتِیْ وَمَوَالِیَّ\nashhadu ya mawlaya annaka wal-a'immatu min aba'ika a'immati wa mawaliyya\nI bear witness, O my master, that you and the Imams among your forefathers are my Imams and my masters,\nفِیْ الْحَیٰوۃِ الدُّنْیَا وَیَوْمَ الْاَشْهَادِ\nfi alhayati alddunya wa yawma al-ashhadi\nin this worldly life and on the Day of Witnessing.\nاَسْئَلُكَ یَا مَوْلاَیَ اَنْ تَسْئَلَ اللّٰهَ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالیٰ\nas'aluka ya mawlaya an tas'ala allaha tabaraka wa ta`ala\nI ask you, O my master, to ask Allah, Blessed and Exalted,\nفِیْ صَلاَحَ شَانِیْ\nfi salahi sha'ni\nfor the betterment of my affairs,\nوَقَضَائِ حَوَائِجِیْ\nwa qada'i hawa'iji\nand the fulfillment of my needs,\nوَغُفْرَانِ ذُنُوْبِیْ\nwa ghufrani dhunubi\nand the forgiveness of my sins,\nوَالْاَخْذِ بِیَدِیْ فِیْ دِیْنِیْ\nwal-akhdhi biyadi fi dini\nand to take me by the hand in my religion,\nوَدُنْیَایَ وَاٰخِرَتِیْ\nwa dunyaya wa akhirati\nand my worldly life and my Hereafter,\nلِیْ وَلِاِخْوَانِیْ وَاَخَوَانِیَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ كَآفَّۃً\nli wali-ikhwani wa akhawatiya almu'minina walmu'minati kaffatan\nfor me, and for my brothers and sisters among the believing men and women, all of them;\nاِنَّهٗ غَفُوْرٌ رَّحِیْمِ۔\ninnahu ghafurun rahimun\nindeed He is Oft-Forgiving, Most Merciful."
}
